<institution>Department of Internal Medicine, Division of Infectious Diseases, Gil Medical Center, Gachon University College of Medicine</institution>, <addr-line>Incheon</addr-line>, <country country="KR">Republic of Korea</country></aff><xref rid="ofac406-FM2" ref-type="author-notes"/><xref rid="ofac406-cor1" ref-type="corresp"/><!--helppl@gilhospital.com--><xref rid="ofac406-FM3" ref-type="author-notes"/></contrib></contrib-group><author-notes><fn id="ofac406-FM1"><label>a</label><p>J. Y. K., O. S., and L.-L. P. contributed equally to this work.</p></fn><fn id="ofac406-FM2"><label>b</label><p>Ad. S.-C. and J. S. E. contributed equally to this work.</p></fn><fn id="ofac406-FM3" fn-type="COI-statement"><p>
